# Where contact & application form submissions are delivered.
# Leave unset to use FormSubmit, which relays to info@farrukhexpress.com.
# NOTE: FormSubmit needs a one-time activation — the first submission sends a
# confirmation email to that inbox that must be clicked once.
#
# Any service accepting a JSON POST works here (Formspree, Web3Forms, your own API):
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX
